    <!-- The mega corporation courier watches you nervously, one hand never leaving his weapon.\n\n\"I'm just a delivery worker. The ship went down, the cargo is gone, and the company will not listen to excuses. If you want the goods, let me drop the diary and keys I am carrying, then I leave right now. Do not force me to shoot. I do not want this reaching the company level either.\" -->
    <MooGirl.CourierDialogText>这名巨型企业运货员紧张地看着你们，手一直没有离开武器。\n\n“我只是个送货的。飞船掉了，货也没保住，公司不会听我解释。你们要是想拿东西，就让我把身上的日记和钥匙扔下，然后我立刻离开。别逼我开火，我也不想把事情闹到公司层面。”</MooGirl.CourierDialogText>
