    <!-- [Page One]\n\nWelcome to Courier Diary.\n\nThis diary records the experiences of a low-level courier during his time working for the mega corporation. It contains practical advice and survival lessons. -->
    <MooGirl.CourierDiary.Page1>【第一页】\n\n欢迎阅读《运货员日记》！\n\n这本日记记录了一个底层运货员在巨型企业工作期间的种种经历，包含大量实用技巧和生存经验。</MooGirl.CourierDiary.Page1>
    <!-- [Page Two]\n\nAbout the mega corporation:\n\nThe mega corporation is a vast corporate alliance with armed forces spread across many planets. They field distinctive OPIC and PMC weapon series.\n\nWhen facing a raid, pay attention to enemy equipment tiers. Enemies carrying PMC-prefix weapons are usually more dangerous. -->
    <MooGirl.CourierDiary.Page2>【第二页】\n\n关于巨型企业：\n\n巨型企业是一个庞大的企业联合体，其武装力量遍布各个星球。他们拥有独特的OPIC和PMC系列的武器装备。\n\n遭遇袭击时请注意敌人的装备等级——携带PMC前缀武器的敌人往往更危险。</MooGirl.CourierDiary.Page2>
    <!-- [Page Three]\n\nAbout MooGirls:\n\nMooGirls are products of genetic engineering. Their milk has exceptional nutritional value, and MooGirl dairy products can provide additional benefits.\n\nMooGirl milk pudding improves mood, cheese can detoxify, and aged cheese and milk tablets can strengthen immunity. -->
    <MooGirl.CourierDiary.Page3>【第三页】\n\n关于雪牛娘：\n\n雪牛娘是基因工程的产物，她们分泌的乳汁具有非凡的营养价值。可以通过制作各种雪牛娘奶制品来获得额外加成。\n\n雪牛娘奶布丁能提升心情，奶酪可以解毒，陈年奶酪和奶片能增强免疫力。</MooGirl.CourierDiary.Page3>
    <!-- [Page Four]\n\nAbout restraint keys:\n\nCrude restraint keys can be made at machining tables or smithies. Fine restraint keys require more advanced workstations.\n\nIf you find keys carried by a lucky courier, you can use them to unlock restraints on MooGirls. -->
    <MooGirl.CourierDiary.Page4>【第四页】\n\n关于束具钥匙：\n\n粗糙束具钥匙可以在机械加工台或锻造台制作，精致束具钥匙需要更高级的工作台。\n\n如果你捡到了运气好的运货员携带的钥匙，可以用它们来解开雪牛娘身上的束具。</MooGirl.CourierDiary.Page4>
    <!-- [Page Five]\n\nSurvival advice:\n\n1. Develop MooGirl husbandry for a stable milk supply\n2. Build enough defenses against mega corporation raids\n3. Produce dairy foods to strengthen colonists\n4. Restraint keys can help recruit enslaved MooGirls\n\nGood luck surviving this brutal world. -->
    <MooGirl.CourierDiary.Page5>【第五页】\n\n生存建议：\n\n1. 发展雪牛娘养殖以获得稳定的奶源\n2. 积攒足够的防御力量应对巨型企业袭击\n3. 制作各种奶制品以增强殖民者的能力\n4. 束具钥匙可以用来招募雪牛娘奴隶\n\n祝你在这个残酷的世界中活下来！</MooGirl.CourierDiary.Page5>
    <!-- Wanderer Joins: {PAWN_nameDef} -->
