    <!-- Transport pods have crashed, carrying multiple escapees. -->
    <MooGirl.OpeningPodCrash_MultipleIntro>逃生舱坠毁，里面载有多位逃亡者。</MooGirl.OpeningPodCrash_MultipleIntro>
    <!-- Two transport pods have crash-landed nearby, each carrying an escaped Mugirl slave.\nThey just escaped from a mega corporation's slave transport ship- whether due to ship malfunction, attack, or some other means remains unknown. The escape has left them utterly exhausted, and the tightly bound slave restraints on their bodies silently record the pain and submission they endured under the mega corporation's tyranny. The impact has also left {PAWN_pronoun} severely injured.\n\nNow they have nowhere to go. If you choose to rescue them, they will join your colony. Will you give these two pitiful yet lovely escapees a chance at freedom and a new life? -->
    <MooGirl.OpeningPodCrash>两个逃生舱在附近坠毁，每个逃生舱里面载有一名逃脱的雪牛娘奴隶。\n她俩刚刚从巨型企业的奴隶运输船中逃脱，究竟是飞船故障、遭遇攻击，还是她以其他方式逃脱尚不得而知。逃亡的经历令她俩精疲力尽，紧密捆缚在他们身上的奴隶束具，无声记录着她在巨型企业暴政下的痛苦与屈从。由于撞击{PAWN_pronoun}也受了重伤。\n\n如今她俩无处可去，如果你选择营救她俩，她俩会加入你的殖民地，你愿意给这两位可爱又可怜的逃亡者一次自由与新生活的机会吗？</MooGirl.OpeningPodCrash>
    <!-- Among them, {PAWN_nameDef} is a {AGE}-year-old child who has just escaped from a slave caravan and is completely alone. -->
    <MooGirl.OpeningPodCrash_Child>其中{PAWN_nameDef}是个{AGE}岁的孩子，她刚刚逃离了奴隶商队的控制，孤身无依。</MooGirl.OpeningPodCrash_Child>
    <!-- Among them, [PAWN_pronoun] doesn't belong to any faction. You can choose to rescue [PAWN_objective], hoping [PAWN_pronoun] will freely join your colony, or you can choose to capture [PAWN_objective] to recruit or enslave [PAWN_objective]. -->
    <MooGirl.OpeningPodCrash_Factionless>其中{PAWN_pronoun}不属于任何派系。你可以选择救援{PAWN_objective}，希望{PAWN_pronoun}自由加入你的殖民地，也可以选择俘虏{PAWN_objective}以招募或奴役她。</MooGirl.OpeningPodCrash_Factionless>
    <!-- Among them, {PAWN_nameDef} comes from the hostile faction {PAWN_factionName}. You can capture [PAWN_objective] to recruit or enslave [PAWN_objective]. -->
    <MooGirl.OpeningPodCrash_Hostile>其中{PAWN_nameDef}来自敌对派系{PAWN_factionName}，你可以俘虏{PAWN_objective}来招募或奴役。</MooGirl.OpeningPodCrash_Hostile>
    <!-- {PAWN_nameDef} comes from {PAWN_factionName}. If you rescue [PAWN_objective], [PAWN_pronoun] will improve relations between your factions when [PAWN_pronoun] returns.\n\nYou can also capture [PAWN_objective] to recruit or enslave [PAWN_objective], but this will anger [PAWN_possessive] faction. -->
